{"id":"4382c6bdd7033833","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-dspace.md","title":"Deterministic Space","display":"df-dspace — Deterministic Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"display":"df-dspace — Deterministic Space","label":"28-df-dspace","aliases":["28-df-dspace"],"type":"definition","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"78–79","source_pdf_pages":"104–105"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dspace — Deterministic Space"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-dspace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-dspace</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"78–79"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"104–105"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a> 定义的机器集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；工作空间及所有分支停机来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\land\\operatorname{space}_M(x)\\le c\\,s(|x|)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\land\\operatorname{space}_M(x)\\le c\\,s(|x|)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>排除输入带，计入所有工作带的访问格；允许反复复用工作格。明确停机条件，避免以循环机的接受集代替决定语言。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 4.1，印刷 pp.78–79 / PDF pp.104–105。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的机器集。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；工作空间及所有分支停机来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-computation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；工作空间及所有分支停机来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-computation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(\\operatorname{Halt}_M(x)\\land\\operatorname{space}_M(x)\\le c\\,s(|x|)))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1221,"backlinks":[{"id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DSPACE}(s)$ 见 [[28-df-dspace]]，仅计工作带且允许常数因子。"},{"id":"fd829148f31abddc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DSPACE}(t)$ 是 [[28-df-dspace]] 中容许常数因子的二进制语言资源类；$a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"资源函数：[[28-df-big-oh]]、[[28-df-time-constructible]]、[[28-df-space-constructible]]、[[28-df-dtime]]、[[28-df-ntime]]、[[28-df-dspace]]、[[28-df-nspace]]。"},{"id":"58e742656f0db590","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6fe48e4cc479f3fd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e244e427679f34a1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","256220eba4eba968","b5d4fc2d291ce98b"]}